<title>USA: Pepsi Cola Puerto Rico Q1 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>Pepsi Cola Puerto Rico Q1 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.16		    $0.15</p>
<p> Net loss		   3,455		    3,206</p>
<p> Net Sales		 25,798		   29,417</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  21,500		   21,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name Pepsi-Cola Puerto Rico Bottling Co.</p>
<p>Contributing to the net loss in Q1, ending Dec. 31 1996, were extraordinary legal expenses associated with the company's civil lawsuits which were $1.1 million higher than the preceeding Q1.</p>
</text>
